{"duration_api_ms":77062,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a37a299a-ec2d-4b52-a733-d58ffb611e7d","total_cost_usd":0.6050662,"usage":{"input_tokens":20,"cache_creation_input_tokens":50175,"cache_read_input_tokens":395231,"output_tokens":6227,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1930},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":50175,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":601,"cache_read_input_tokens":53634,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2521,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2521},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":20,"outputTokens":6227,"cacheReadInputTokens":395231,"cacheCreationInputTokens":50175,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6050662,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1930,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01WY5oHYqQTLa7VU9DGJHkoT","tool_input":{"command":"for f in breaks/*; do echo \"== $f\"; cat \"$f\"; done; echo; cat .verify/gate-test.*.txt","description":"Read break patches and test gate report"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_011Q7dT1wY289sYUVAhoixuk","tool_input":{"command":"cd /Users/christoph/Privat/domain-centric-architecture/dca-ecommerce-sample-dotnet && for p in tasks/CAT-05/breaks/*.patch; do git apply --check \"$p\" && echo \"applies: $p\"; done","description":"Check that each break patch applies cleanly"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01GjeYJKZF2Y9oxZDnYudiYa","tool_input":{"command":"cd /Users/christoph/Privat/domain-centric-architecture/dca-ecommerce-sample-dotnet && git apply --check tasks/CAT-05/breaks/DcaShop.E2eTests.SiteHeaderE2eTest--TheLogoLeadsFromAProductPageToTheHomePage.patch && git apply --check tasks/CAT-05/breaks/DcaShop.IntegrationTests.SiteLayoutTest--HomeInTheHeaderNavigationOpensTheHomePage.patch && git apply --check tasks/CAT-05/breaks/DcaShop.IntegrationTests.SiteLayoutTest--ProductsInTheHeaderNavigationOpensTheCatalogue.patch && git apply --check tasks/CAT-05/breaks/DcaShop.IntegrationTests.SiteLayoutTest--TheFooterNamesTheShopAndLinksToTheEventLog.patch && git apply --check tasks/CAT-05/breaks/DcaShop.IntegrationTests.SiteLayoutTest--TheHomePageShowsTheSameHeaderAndFooterAsTheCatalogue.patch && echo all-apply","description":"Check that all five break patches apply cleanly"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":11,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The judge stage for CAT-05 returned **`verdict: pass`** and wrote `tasks/CAT-05/judge.md`. No defects were confirmed.\n\nCAT-05 is an adopted story: it describes behaviour the shop already has, so nothing was built. The review therefore only checked whether each of the five tests proves its scenario, and whether its break patch would turn it red.\n\n- **Tests against scenarios:** every test sets up the scenario's starting page, follows the link and checks every outcome with the scenario's own values. That includes the logo text, the \"Home\" and \"Products\" link texts, the footer text with its em dash, the Event Log link to `/backoffice/events`, and the home page's header and footer matching the catalogue's.\n- **Test levels:** only the story's happy path, `logo-leads-home`, runs in the browser. The other four are integration tests.\n- **Break patches:** the test stage wrote them by hand and never applied them. I compared each one line by line with `_Layout.cshtml`, and they all match the current file. Each changes only what its own test checks. I could not run `git apply --check` because it wasn't approved, so the gate still has to confirm they apply cleanly.\n- **One open item that doesn't block:** the browser test's title, \"Logo leads home\", has to appear in the specification's `scenarios.md`, and a Java test needs the same title. The shared-scenarios check fails otherwise, though it only runs when the specification path is set. The specification was outside this stage's inputs, so I didn't check it. It's for you to add, since you own the semantics.\n- **Perspectives:** the ddd, hexagonal and dca reviews weren't run, since no production code changed. Clean-code was applied to the new test code.\n\nI ran no other stage.","ttft_ms":4707,"type":"result","duration_ms":77432,"uuid":"e004b9f4-a6e4-485b-b41e-4f508e38156d","ttft_stream_ms":3437,"time_to_request_ms":43,"first_content_frame_ms":3438,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
